8-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd71b0d8b-8d95-49b3-9199-5b19ff9a9a03_60x21.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sbNd!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd71b0d8b-8d95-49b3-9199-5b19ff9a9a03_60x21.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sbNd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd71b0d8b-8d95-49b3-9199-5b19ff9a9a03_60x21.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p>Though depends on your perspective. For example, option markets were pricing in less volatility than we saw in January/February period, and much less than we saw last August.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q5vj!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09cdeb2e-ae76-4a69-8a47-9a309934978e_60x22.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q5vj!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09cdeb2e-ae76-4a69-8a47-9a309934978e_60x22.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q5vj!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09cdeb2e-ae76-4a69-8a47-9a309934978e_60x22.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q5vj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaw